<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES CLOSE OF PLAY SCORE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES CLOSE OF PLAY SCORE.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play score on the</p>
<p>first day of a four-day Supersport Series cricket match on</p>
<p>Thursday:</p>
<p>In Paarl: Boland 170 (A.Kuiper 74) and 2-0, Northern</p>
<p>Transvaal 117 (H.Williams 4-31)</p>
